WEBVTT

00:05:57.118 --> 00:06:00.238
and she said, "Let's find
our way to Florida."

00:06:01.374 --> 00:06:03.923
And we started, and for the next 53 hours,

00:06:03.947 --> 00:06:08.373
it was an intense,
unforgettable life experience.

00:06:09.647 --> 00:06:11.864
The highs were high, the awe --

00:06:11.888 --> 00:06:14.213
I'm not a religious person,
but I'll tell you,

00:06:14.237 --> 00:06:17.662
to be in the azure blue of the Gulf Stream

00:06:17.686 --> 00:06:19.566
as if, as you're breathing,

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:23.609
you're looking down miles
and miles and miles,

00:06:24.253 --> 00:06:29.162
to feel the majesty
of this blue planet we live on --

00:06:29.186 --> 00:06:32.576
it's awe-inspiring.